{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>As the blessing</b> — כ is like (the phrase) \"the blessing of YHWH your Elohim that He has given you\" in the case of an olah of appearance, and this is what was taught in the Mishnah: one who has abundant food brings abundant olot, and this is \"you shall slaughter and eat flesh\" — \"you shall slaughter\" meaning olah, \"and eat flesh\" meaning shelamim; everything increases according to the blessing of YHWH your Elohim that He has given you."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:33.181713665Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}